# .cursorrules — Stratum Hub Rules for AI and IDE

# 1. Architectural Integrity
- Maintain the single-source-of-truth directory for all Stratum repositories.
- Enforce the foundational principle: "Isolation by design, not by discipline".
- Ensure repository links, component names, and compatibility matrix stay synchronized.
- The Zero Host Ports invariant must be enforced across all documentation and guides.

# 2. Versioning & Licensing
- All artifacts must specify: Apache License, Version 2.0 (Apache-2.0).
- Author and Copyright: Sandra Gabriela Puerto Torres (SGPT) / Isora Cloud Group (ICG).
- Canonical URLs point to https://isora.com.co and https://stratum.isora.com.co.
- Official brand: Stratum Sovereign Multi-Tenant Architecture.
